{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>As one of us, to know good and evil.</b> He knows good and evil while still being in our image; and if he were to be eternal in this condition, he would pursue all his days after the pleasurable and cast behind his back every intellectual apprehension and every good deed, and would never attain the spiritual felicity intended by the blessed El through His image and likeness."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:55.539057721Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}